# 17. Button

## Variants

```text
primary
secondary
tertiary
ghost
destructive
```

## Sizes

```text
compact
standard
large
```

## States

```text
default
hover
active
focus
disabled
loading
```

## Rules

Primary action should be visually dominant.

Avoid multiple competing primary buttons in one local action group.

Loading state must preserve button width where practical.

A loading button must not accept duplicate activation.

