# 101. Component State Contract

Every interactive or data-bearing component must define applicable states.

Minimum state vocabulary:

```text
default
hover
active
focus
selected
disabled
loading
empty
error
success
```

Domain components may add:

```text
queued
running
blocked
atRisk
completed
cancelled
```

---

# 102. Loading Contract

Loading strategy depends on operation duration.

## Short interaction

Use:

```text
spinner
button loading
inline progress
```

## Page/resource fetch

Use:

```text
skeleton
loading state
```

## Long-running job

Use:

```text
persistent execution state
progress/stage
notification
activity/event
```

