Validation
 ↓
QA/Judge
 ↓
Persistence
 ↓
Document Rendering
```

The UI should make these stages understandable.

---

# 143. Generated vs Canonical UI

Always distinguish:

```text
AI-generated proposal
```

from:

```text
validated / approved / persisted project state
```

This is a critical trust rule.

