# 144. Component State Matrix

For major components:

| Component | Loading | Empty | Error | Focus | Disabled | Dark |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Button | ✓ | — | optional | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |
| Input | — | — | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |
| DataTable | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |
